---
const situations = [
  ['Inherited property','A simple path when you are handling a home after a loss.'],
  ['Tenant occupied','Sell without waiting on renovations or listing prep.'],
  ['Repairs needed','No need to fix the roof, kitchen, foundation, or anything else first.'],
  ['Behind on taxes','We can work with title to understand what is owed and what comes next.'],
  ['Vacant home','Skip months of carrying costs and uncertainty.'],
  ['Need to move','Choose a closing timeline that works with your next step.']
];
const faqs = [
  ['Do I need to make repairs?','No. We evaluate homes in their current condition, so you can skip repairs, cleanup, and showings.'],
  ['Is requesting an offer a commitment?','No. There is no obligation to accept an offer.'],
  ['How fast can I close?','Timing depends on title and the property, but we can often work around your preferred move date.'],
  ['Are there agent commissions?','When we purchase directly, there are no traditional listing commissions.']
];
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1" />
  <title>Neighborly Offer | Sell Your Home Simply</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Get a straightforward cash offer for your home. Sell as-is, skip repairs and showings, and choose your timeline." />
  <style>
    :root{--cyan:#14b8e7;--cyan2:#e9f9fd;--ink:#15191d;--muted:#67727c;--paper:#ffffff;--soft:#f7f9fa;--line:#e8edef;--sand:#f5f1e9;--shadow:0 24px 70px rgba(24,41,50,.10)}
    *{box-sizing:border-box}html{scroll-behavior:smooth}body{margin:0;background:var(--paper);color:var(--ink);font-family:Inter,ui-sans-serif,system-ui,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,"Segoe UI",sans-serif;line-height:1.5}a{text-decoration:none;color:inherit}button,input{font:inherit}.wrap{width:min(1180px,calc(100% - 42px));margin:auto}.muted{color:var(--muted)}
    .nav{height:84px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:30px}.logo{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;font-weight:850;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:-1px}.logo-mark{width:42px;height:42px}.logo-word span{font-weight:450;color:#687179}.navlinks{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:30px;font-size:14px;font-weight:700}.btn{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;min-height:52px;padding:0 22px;border:0;border-radius:12px;background:var(--ink);color:#fff;font-weight:800;cursor:pointer}.btn.cyan{background:var(--cyan);color:#08222c}.btn.ghost{background:#fff;color:var(--ink);border:1px solid var(--line)}
    .hero{padding:54px 0 40px}.hero-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.02fr .98fr;gap:78px;align-items:center}.kicker{display:inline-flex;gap:9px;align-items:center;font-size:13px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:1.7px;font-weight:850;color:#1183a2}.kdot{width:8px;height:8px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--cyan)}h1{font-size:68px;line-height:.98;letter-spacing:-4.5px;margin:18px 0 22px;max-width:700px}.hero-copy{font-size:20px;color:#5d6871;max-width:610px;margin:0}.offer-form{display:flex;gap:10px;margin-top:30px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #dfe6e9;box-shadow:0 16px 44px rgba(20,48,58,.08);border-radius:15px;padding:8px;max-width:640px}.offer-form input{flex:1;border:0;outline:0;padding:0 16px;font-size:16px;min-width:0}.fine{font-size:12px;color:#82909a;margin-top:11px}.hero-photo{position:relative}.photo-shell{border-radius:30px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:var(--shadow);background:#ddd;aspect-ratio:1.03/1}.photo-shell img{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;display:block}.photo-overlay{position:absolute;left:-34px;bottom:34px;background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:18px;padding:18px 20px;box-shadow:0 18px 50px rgba(21,36,45,.13);width:245px}.photo-overlay strong{display:block;font-size:17px}.photo-overlay small{color:var(--muted)}.scribble{position:absolute;right:-28px;top:-30px;width:95px;height:95px;opacity:.95}
    .trust{padding:28px 0 34px}.trust-inner{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:18px;overflow:hidden;background:#fff}.trust-item{padding:25px 28px;display:flex;gap:14px;align-items:center;border-right:1px solid var(--line)}.trust-item:last-child{border:0}.mini-icon{width:38px;height:38px;border-radius:10px;background:var(--cyan2);display:grid;place-items:center;font-weight:900;color:#0e90b2}.trust-item b{display:block}.trust-item span{display:block;font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)}
    .section{padding:104px 0}.section.soft{background:var(--soft)}.section.sand{background:var(--sand)}.eyebrow{font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.8px;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:850;color:#108aaa}.section h2{font-size:50px;line-height:1.05;letter-spacing:-3px;margin:13px 0 16px}.section-lead{font-size:18px;color:var(--muted);max-width:670px}.center{text-align:center}.center .section-lead{margin-inline:auto}.split{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:80px;align-items:center}.how-card{background:#fff;border-radius:24px;padding:10px;border:1px solid var(--line);box-shadow:0 18px 60px rgba(21,43,52,.07)}.step{display:grid;grid-template-columns:50px 1fr;gap:16px;padding:26px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}.step:last-child{border:0}.step-num{width:42px;height:42px;border-radius:50%;display:grid;place-items:center;background:var(--cyan);font-weight:900}.step h3{margin:0 0 5px;font-size:20px}.step p{margin:0;color:var(--muted)}.sketch-card{position:relative;background:#dff6fb;border-radius:30px;min-height:520px;overflow:hidden}.sketch-house{position:absolute;inset:40px 50px 30px;display:grid;place-items:center}.sketch-house svg{width:100%;height:100%}.note{position:absolute;background:#fff;border-radius:14px;border:1px solid var(--line);padding:12px 15px;box-shadow:0 12px 35px rgba(21,44,54,.09);font-size:13px;font-weight:750}.n1{top:25px;left:24px}.n2{bottom:24px;right:24px}
    .benefit-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:18px;margin-top:46px}.benefit{background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:20px;padding:28px}.benefit svg{width:38px;height:38px}.benefit h3{font-size:21px;margin:18px 0 8px}.benefit p{color:var(--muted);margin:0}.situation-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:16px;margin-top:46px}.situation{background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:18px;padding:23px}.situation b{display:block;font-size:17px;margin-bottom:6px}.situation span{font-size:14px;color:var(--muted)}
    .image-band{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.1fr .9fr;gap:20px;margin-top:48px}.image-card{border-radius:24px;overflow:hidden;min-height:360px;position:relative}.image-card img{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover}.image-caption{position:absolute;left:20px;bottom:20px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.94);backdrop-filter:blur(8px);border-radius:14px;padding:14px 16px;font-weight:800}.image-caption small{display:block;color:var(--muted);font-weight:600;margin-top:2px}.quote-box{display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:space-between;background:var(--ink);color:#fff;border-radius:24px;padding:34px}.quote-box blockquote{font-size:29px;line-height:1.2;letter-spacing:-1.1px;margin:0}.quote-box p{color:#b9c2c8;margin:28px 0 0}
    .faq{max-width:900px;margin:42px auto 0}.faq details{background:#fff;border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding:22px 0}.faq details:last-child{border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}.faq summary{cursor:pointer;list-style:none;font-weight:800;font-size:18px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between}.faq summary::-webkit-details-marker{display:none}.faq summary:after{content:'+';color:#1497b9;font-size:24px}.faq details[open] summary:after{content:'–'}.faq p{color:var(--muted);max-width:740px;margin:12px 0 0}
    .cta{margin:0 auto 95px;background:#e5f8fc;border-radius:30px;padding:58px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr .88fr;gap:45px;align-items:center;position:relative;overflow:hidden}.cta:after{content:'';position:absolute;width:180px;height:180px;border:3px solid rgba(20,184,231,.22);border-radius:50%;right:-70px;top:-70px}.cta h2{font-size:44px;line-height:1.05;letter-spacing:-2.6px;margin:0 0 12px}.cta p{color:#56707b;margin:0}.cta .offer-form{margin:0;position:relative;z-index:2}.footer{border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding:38px 0 52px}.footer-row{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:30px;font-size:13px;color:#7a8790}
    @media(max-width:900px){.navlinks a:not(.btn){display:none}.hero-grid,.split,.image-band,.cta{grid-template-columns:1fr}.hero-grid{gap:38px}h1{font-size:48px;letter-spacing:-2.8px}.photo-overlay{left:16px}.trust-inner,.benefit-grid,.situation-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.trust-item{border-right:0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}.section{padding:74px 0}.section h2{font-size:38px;letter-spacing:-2px}.sketch-card{min-height:400px}.cta{margin:0 20px 70px;padding:36px 24px}.footer-row{align-items:flex-start;flex-direction:column}}
    @media(max-width:620px){.wrap{width:min(100% - 28px,1180px)}.nav{height:72px}.logo{font-size:20px}.logo-mark{width:35px;height:35px}.nav .btn{min-height:44px;padding:0 15px}.hero{padding-top:30px}.hero h1{font-size:42px;letter-spacing:-2.4px}.hero-copy{font-size:18px}.offer-form{flex-direction:column}.offer-form input{min-height:48px}.photo-shell{aspect-ratio:.92/1}.section h2{font-size:35px}.quote-box blockquote{font-size:24px}.cta h2{font-size:36px}}
  </style>
</head>
<body>
<header><div class="wrap nav"><a class="logo" href="#top"><svg class="logo-mark" viewBox="0 0 48 48" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6 22.5 24 7l18 15.5V41H29V28H19v13H6V22.5Z" stroke="#14b8e7" stroke-width="5.5" stroke-linejoin="round"/><path d="M16 33V18l16 17V18" stroke="#15191d" stroke-width="5.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg><span class="logo-word">Neighborly <span>Offer</span></span></a><nav class="navlinks"><a href="#how">How it works</a><a href="#situations">Why sell to us</a><a href="#faq">FAQ</a><a class="btn" href="#offer">Get my offer</a></nav></div></header>
<main id="top">
<section class="hero"><div class="wrap hero-grid"><div><div class="kicker"><span class="kdot"></span>A more neighborly way to sell</div><h1>Sell your home simply. Move on confidently.</h1><p class="hero-copy">Get a straightforward cash offer, skip repairs and showings, and choose a closing timeline that works for you.</p><form class="offer-form" id="offer" onsubmit="event.preventDefault()"><input aria-label="Property address" placeholder="Enter your property address" autocomplete="street-address"/><button class="btn cyan" type="submit">Get my offer</button></form><div class="fine">No obligation · No repairs · No showings</div></div><div class="hero-photo"><div class="photo-shell"><img src="/images/cash-offer-vs-listing-house-houston.jpg" alt="Home exterior"/></div><div class="photo-overlay"><strong>Your home. Your timeline.</strong><small>We work around your next move.</small></div><svg class="scribble" viewBox="0 0 100 100" fill="none"><path d="M49 5v20M49 75v20M5 50h20M75 50h20M18 18l14 14M68 68l14 14M82 18 68 32M32 68 18 82" stroke="#14b8e7" stroke-width="4" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg></div></div></section>
<section class="trust"><div class="wrap trust-inner"><div class="trust-item"><div class="mini-icon">✓</div><div><b>Sell as-is</b><span>No renovations or cleanup first</span></div></div><div class="trust-item"><div class="mini-icon">$</div><div><b>No traditional commissions</b><span>Keep the process straightforward</span></div></div><div class="trust-item"><div class="mini-icon">↗</div><div><b>Choose your timeline</b><span>Close when it works for you</span></div></div></div></section>
<section class="section" id="how"><div class="wrap split"><div><div class="eyebrow">How it works</div><h2>Three steps. No maze.</h2><p class="section-lead">Neighborly Offer keeps the process clear from the first conversation through closing.</p><div class="how-card"><div class="step"><div class="step-num">1</div><div><h3>Tell us about the home</h3><p>Start with the property address and a few simple details.</p></div></div><div class="step"><div class="step-num">2</div><div><h3>Review your offer</h3><p>We review the property and explain the numbers in plain language.</p></div></div><div class="step"><div class="step-num">3</div><div><h3>Pick your closing date</h3><p>If the offer works, choose the timing that fits your plans.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="sketch-card"><div class="note n1">No repairs needed</div><div class="sketch-house"><svg viewBox="0 0 520 420" fill="none"><path d="M76 205 258 58l186 147" stroke="#14b8e7" stroke-width="18" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/><path d="M111 186v186h295V186" stroke="#15191d" stroke-width="10" stroke-linecap="round"/><path d="M208 372V249h101v123" stroke="#15191d" stroke-width="10"/><path d="M140 232h49v49h-49zM329 232h49v49h-49z" stroke="#15191d" stroke-width="9"/><path d="M92 101c-21 7-38 19-52 36M438 72c24 11 41 27 52 48M434 334c24 7 42 19 54 37" stroke="#14b8e7" stroke-width="6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-dasharray="3 13"/></svg></div><div class="note n2">Close on your schedule</div></div></div></section>
<section class="section soft"><div class="wrap"><div class="center"><div class="eyebrow">Why Neighborly Offer</div><h2>Built to make selling feel lighter.</h2><p class="section-lead">Less prep. Fewer unknowns. A simpler path from “maybe” to “done.”</p></div><div class="benefit-grid"><article class="benefit"><svg viewBox="0 0 48 48" fill="none"><path d="M8 24 21 36 41 11" stroke="#14b8e7" stroke-width="5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg><h3>Skip the prep work</h3><p>No staging, open houses, or weeks spent getting the home “market ready.”</p></article><article class="benefit"><svg viewBox="0 0 48 48" fill="none"><circle cx="24" cy="24" r="16" stroke="#14b8e7" stroke-width="4"/><path d="M24 14v11l8 5" stroke="#15191d" stroke-width="4" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg><h3>Move at your pace</h3><p>We can work around tenants, family logistics, moving dates, and title issues.</p></article><article class="benefit"><svg viewBox="0 0 48 48" fill="none"><path d="M8 24h32M24 8v32" stroke="#14b8e7" stroke-width="4" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg><h3>Clear communication</h3><p>Real people, straightforward answers, and no pressure to make a decision on the spot.</p></article></div></div></section>
<section class="section" id="situations"><div class="wrap"><div class="split"><div><div class="eyebrow">Whatever brought you here</div><h2>Real-life situations need flexible options.</h2><p class="section-lead">Every seller has a different story. We keep the conversation focused on what actually works for you.</p></div><div class="situation-grid">{situations.map(([title,copy])=><div class="situation"><b>{title}</b><span>{copy}</span></div>)}</div></div><div class="image-band"><div class="image-card"><img src="/images/inherited-house-probate-detroit.jpg" alt="Residential home"/><div class="image-caption">Sell without the usual prep<small>As-is means as-is.</small></div></div><div class="quote-box"><blockquote>“The goal is simple: make the next step easier than the last one.”</blockquote><p>Neighborly Offer is built around clarity, speed, and a homeowner-first conversation.</p></div></div></div></section>
<section class="section sand" id="faq"><div class="wrap center"><div class="eyebrow">Questions, answered</div><h2>Know what to expect.</h2><div class="faq">{faqs.map(([q,a])=><details><summary>{q}</summary><p>{a}</p></details>)}</div></div></section>
<div class="wrap"><section class="cta"><div><h2>See what your home could sell for.</h2><p>Start with the property address. No obligation.</p></div><form class="offer-form" onsubmit="event.preventDefault()"><input aria-label="Property address" placeholder="Enter your property address" autocomplete="street-address"/><button class="btn" type="submit">Get started</button></form></section></div>
</main>
<footer class="footer"><div class="wrap footer-row"><a class="logo" href="#top" style="font-size:18px"><svg class="logo-mark" viewBox="0 0 48 48" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6 22.5 24 7l18 15.5V41H29V28H19v13H6V22.5Z" stroke="#14b8e7" stroke-width="5.5" stroke-linejoin="round"/><path d="M16 33V18l16 17V18" stroke="#15191d" stroke-width="5.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg><span>Neighborly Offer</span></a><div>© 2026 Neighborly Offer</div><div>Privacy · Terms</div></div></footer>
</body></html>